要的解释之外，没有本研究申办者的书面授权许可，任何个人不得分发、复制、发表或披露本文件的任何内容。","quote_sha256":"d3976b422836e5d93cd93a395540bc130594aa10264f0d02dc4e28061227510b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","span_id":"es_03"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_01","es_02","es_03"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理结合研究者手册、既往临床数据及伦理委员会要求确认知情同意书内容清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ic_01","missing_source_classes":["项目知情同意书模板","研究者手册"],"target":"知情同意书应包含的具体条目与披露内容"},{"action":"确认方案修订、新增风险或研究设计变更时是否需要再知情及具体操作方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ic_02","missing_source_classes":["项目知情同意操作规范"],"target":"再知情同意触发条件与操作流程"},{"action":"由医学经理和伦理委员会确认特殊人群入组时的同意方式及限制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ic_03","missing_source_classes":["项目知情同意操作规范","伦理委员会审查意见"],"target":"特殊人群的同意与代理同意流程"}],"heading":"知情同意","missing_source_classes":["项目知情同意书模板及内容清单","特殊人群同意与代理同意操作规范","再知情触发条件与流程","撤回同意后数据处理规则"],"proposal_text":"本研究知情同意在筛选期（D-28至D-1）完成，研究者须在受试者接受任何研究相关操作之前，向受试者充分说明研究目的、预期获益与风险、替代治疗选择、随机化与盲法安排、访视与检查流程、数据使用与隐私保护措施以及自愿参加与随时退出的权利。知情同意书的签署须遵守《药物临床试验质量管理规范》及《赫尔辛基宣言》的要求，在获得伦理委员会书面批准及参与者书面知情同意之后方可实施该临床试验。受试者签署知情同意书时，研究者应向其做必要的解释，确保受试者在充分理解的基础上自愿签署。受试者有权在任何时间、无需说明理由地撤回知情同意并退出研究。","rationale":"筛选期含知情同意、入选排除评估和基线检查为项目已确认事实；GCP与赫尔辛基宣言合规要求及知情同意时做必要解释的表述来源于公司共享语料中的监管共性条款。知情同意书具体条目、再知情触发条件、特殊人群代理同意流程及撤回后数据处理细则缺少项目专属来源，需医学经理结合研究者手册和伦理委员会要求补充确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f601cf2900ea_94c36b8e26e06421","section_number":"11.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37c90b76fd34c78a99af4ab7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_93770498fcb5c10bff47:r6:88631defcb8d2380","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9939b9aa574982","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:99911e01a39256"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261008215101_e415cde9","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:199|chunk:1","quote":"申办者只有在接到伦理委员会的批准件后才能提供研究药物。","quote_sha256":"1c7a8bc5fadccbf6c567c585352c3227811bb7b5237d4eed85c4685c3db1e788","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:199|chunk:1","quote":"同时必须告知伦理委员会可能会影响参与者安全和继续参加研究的后续方案增补件和在试验过程中发生的严重不良事件。","quote_sha256":"2780584938cabbaf6ac9b6fda6a9807c3830a26aea7531a3ced88e0c6350c727","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","span_id":"es_05"},{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:199|chunk:1","quote":"研究者有责任向伦理委员会报告有关研究的进展情况。","quote_sha256":"8ff606d8c3e6dc406a5b35df40fd55970a11e3059b2adc319a58bb788db290b3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","span_id":"es_06"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_04","es_05","es_06"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认本项目采用的伦理审查模式及各中心伦理委员会信息","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ec_01","missing_source_classes":["项目伦理审查协调文件"],"target":"多中心伦理审查模式（组长单位主审或各中心独立审查）"},{"action":"确认各中心伦理委员会对年度跟踪审查的具体频率和提交材料要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ec_02","missing_source_classes":["项目伦理委员会审查要求"],"target":"年度跟踪审查频率及持续审查要求"}],"heading":"伦理委员会","missing_source_classes":["项目伦理委员会批件及审查模式文件","年度跟踪审查频率规定","多中心伦理审查协调机制"],"proposal_text":"本研究在启动前须获得各参与中心伦理委员会的书面批准。研究者应将研究方案、知情同意书以及其他必需的材料交于伦理委员会供其审阅及批准，申办者只有在接到伦理委员会的批准件后才能提供研究药物。在研究进行期间，如果研究方案、知情同意书等有任何新增修订，都应根据法规再次获得相关管理单位的书面核准意见。同时必须告知伦理委员会可能会影响参与者安全和继续参加研究的后续方案增补件和在试验过程中发生的严重不良事件。研究者有责任向伦理委员会报告有关研究的进展情况，并须及时将与伦理委员会之间的所有通讯副本交予申办者。伦理委员会在审阅及批准研究方案时，必须确认方案编号，并注明已评审的方案文件及评审日期。","rationale":"伦理委员会审批流程、方案增补件与严重不良事件报告义务、研究者向伦理委员会报告进展的责任来源于公司共享语料中的监管共性条款。本项目伦理委员会名称、批件编号、年度跟踪审查频率及多中心伦理审查模式（组长单位主审或各中心独立审查）缺少项目文件，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f601cf2900ea_762ac8d3b80fd18a","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37c90b76fd34c78a99af4ab7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_93770498fcb5c10bff47:r6:88631defcb8d2380","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9939b9aa574982","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:99911e01a39256"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261008215101_e415cde9","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究方案|block:3|chunk:1","quote":"本文件中的信息保密，所有权归申办者。根据中国法律法规要求，本文件仅提供给研究者和伦理委员会、监督管理部门等相关的机构审阅。","quote_sha256":"4f5c07ce470a95a86d7f9d50dd5a3cc69daf4170f29b742146e2d67dea109370","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","span_id":"es_07"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"72212ddd536730d0a2974c4030273f17907d9fd3cf58c34a35757517fed79947","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"es_08"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_07","es_08"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理与数据管理部门确认电子数据采集系统权限管理及数据保留期限","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_privacy_01","missing_source_classes":["项目数据管理计划","电子数据采集系统权限方案"],"target":"受试者个人健康数据的收集、存储、访问权限及保留期限"},{"action":"确认是否存在数据跨境传输需求及相应合规安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_privacy_02","missing_source_classes":["项目数据跨境传输合规文件"],"target":"受试者健康数据跨境传输安排"}],"heading":"保密与隐私","missing_source_classes":["项目数据保护影响评估文件","受试者健康数据跨境传输安排","电子数据采集系统访问权限管理方案","数据保留期限规定"],"proposal_text":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，根据中国法律法规要求，本文件仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。必须告知接收本文件信息的人员其接收的信息是保密的，不得进一步对外披露。受试者的个人健康信息在研究过程中应予以保护，相关数据的收集、存储、使用和传输须符合中国个人信息保护及人类遗传资源管理的相关法规要求。","rationale":"方案信息保密、所有权归申办者、仅提供给相关机构审阅、未经授权不得分发复制披露、知情同意时做必要解释为保密例外等表述来源于公司共享语料中的监管共性条款。项目数据保护影响评估、受试者健康数据跨境传输安排、电子数据采集系统访问权限管理及数据保留期限缺少项目文件，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f601cf2900ea_d0d8a0639f3e3b67","section_number":"11.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37c90b76fd34c78a99af4ab7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_93770498fcb5c10bff47:r6:88631defcb8d2380","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9939b9aa574982","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a52c2cd5afd5b9","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:99911e01a39256"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261008215101_e415cde9","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理与法务部门确认本项目保险方案、赔偿范围与限额","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ins_01","missing_source_classes":["项目临床试验责任保险保单","赔偿协议模板"],"target":"临床试验责任保险保单条款及赔偿范围"},{"action":"确认受试者因参与研究受到伤害时的赔偿申请流程、责任认定标准及争议解决方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ins_02","missing_source_classes":["项目受试者赔偿操作规范","责任认定机制文件"],"target":"受试者伤害赔偿申请流程及责任认定机制"}],"heading":"保险与赔偿","missing_source_classes":["项目临床试验责任保险保单条款","赔偿范围与限额规定","受试者伤害赔偿申请流程","责任认定机制"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节缺少项目临床试验责任保险保单条款、赔偿范围与限额、受试者伤害赔偿申请流程及责任认定机制的项目文件，无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_r